["id"] = "s17_3104",
["timestamp"] = 1777447228,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Astalor Bloodsworn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Astalor Bloodsworn says: The Twilight's Blade serve Xal'atath, but even lackeys wield power. Let us take what's theirs.",
["id"] = "s17_3105",
["timestamp"] = 1777447286,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Dracthyr",
["class"] = "EVOKER",
["name"] = "Voltarynn-Dalaran",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Voltarynn-Dalaran:190:GUILD:|h[|cff33937fVoltarynn|r]|h: Dorliss ?",
["id"] = "s17_3106",
["timestamp"] = 1777447477,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Little is known about the Root of the World beyond its name. Together, we must uncover more.",
["id"] = "s17_3107",
["timestamp"] = 1777447509,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY",
["type"] = "CURRENCY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3344:0|h[Champion Dawncrest]|h|rx30",
["id"] = "s17_3108",
["timestamp"] = 1777447530,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY",
["type"] = "CURRENCY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx500",
["id"] = "s17_3109",
["timestamp"] = 1777447530,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: Long before the haranir came to this land, the goddess slept in her cradle.",
["id"] = "s17_3110",
["timestamp"] = 1777447550,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: For countless eons she was at peace, her power growing with this world, until....",
["id"] = "s17_3111",
["timestamp"] = 1777447557,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: She cried out in terror as the intruder snatched her away, took her from her cradle, and left a scar of destruction.",
["id"] = "s17_3112",
["timestamp"] = 1777447564,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: The Rift of Aln... Is that why her voice is so loud and terrifying there?",
["id"] = "s17_3113",
["timestamp"] = 1777447571,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: Yes. It echoes with her screams, and is haunted by her nightmares. For not only was she taken... but she has been imprisoned.",
["id"] = "s17_3114",
["timestamp"] = 1777447578,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: Our goddess is held captive against her will, unable to return to the Cradle and we who follow her voice.",
["id"] = "s17_3115",
["timestamp"] = 1777447587,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: And who did this?",
["id"] = "s17_3116",
["timestamp"] = 1777447595,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: We know only that it was a powerful force not of this world.",
["id"] = "s17_3117",
["timestamp"] = 1777447597,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: If the others knew this, they would rage to the surface and tear the world apart to find her. We feared such an exodus would mean the end of our people.",
["id"] = "s17_3118",
["timestamp"] = 1777447602,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Aksem",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Aksem says: But you, Orweyna, have found us allies who could match this immense power. Perhaps the time for caution has passed.",
["id"] = "s17_3119",
["timestamp"] = 1777447613,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: I swear, elder, I will find the goddess wherever she has been taken. And I will see her brought home.",
["id"] = "s17_3120",
["timestamp"] = 1777447624,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
