r\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Justhunt-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Justhunt-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62154:Player-1335-06F2340A:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: A Different Kind of Void (Hard)]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s7_2918\",\"timestamp\":1773823426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dordok-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dordok-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Dordok-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62154:Player-1335-06882EAF:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: A Different Kind of Void (Hard)]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s7_2919\",\"timestamp\":1773823426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The haranir always avoided the Rift of Aln. The dissonant echoes of the goddess's song brought madness. The violent manifestations within brought death.\",\"id\":\"s7_2920\",\"timestamp\":1773823440},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: But a creature called Morta'ka led the manifestations from the rift, threatening all of Harandar.\",\"id\":\"s7_2921\",\"timestamp\":1773823452},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:1312:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: JPP de ce jeu\",\"id\":\"s7_2922\",\"timestamp\":1773823453},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:1313:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: -_-\",\"id\":\"s7_2923\",\"timestamp\":1773823455},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Obayo knew the Echoless Flame was their best hope.\",\"id\":\"s7_2924\",\"timestamp\":1773823460},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Morta'ka\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Morta'ka yells: Kill the haranir! Destroy Harandar! All will join in the discordant chorus!\",\"id\":\"s7_2925\",\"timestamp\":1773823464},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: In the presence of the Echoless Flame, none could hear the goddess's song.\",\"id\":\"s7_2926\",\"timestamp\":1773823555},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The manifestations were wracked by the discordant song of the rift, but the Echoless Flame brought them peace.\",\"id\":\"s7_2927\",\"timestamp\":1773823563},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Obayo knew that the power remaining within the Echoless Flame was not enough to destroy Morta'ka.\",\"id\":\"s7_2928\",\"timestamp\":1773823610},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Instead, the flame was split into three wards that would contain the beast and save all of Harandar.\",\"id\":\"s7_2929\",\"timestamp\":1773823617},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Morta'ka\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Morta'ka says: NOOOooooooo... You haven't seen the last of me!\",\"id\":\"s7_2930\",\"timestamp\":1773823642},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Morta'ka was contained, but the creature continues to plague the Rift of Aln even to this day.\",\"id\":\"s7_2931\",\"timestamp\":1773823648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Obayo found the flames were not all that was sacrificed. She no longer heard the goddess. The connection had been burned out of her.\",\"id\":\"s7_2932\",\"timestamp\":1773823656},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:266002::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Broken Trap Mechanism]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s7_2933\",\"timestamp\":1773823658},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: She saw in this not pain, but duty. Immune to the echoes, she hunted the shadows within the rift, and trained any who made her sacrifice to do the same.\",\"id\":\"s7_2934\",\"timestamp\":1773823665},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:255825::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Disarmed Trap]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s7_2935\",\"timestamp\":1773823681},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s7_2936\",\"timestamp\":1773823682},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s7_2937\",\"timestamp\":1773823682},{\"recor