ge-Mannoroth receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s7_4488\",\"timestamp\":1773867864},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: What does my eagle spy with her shiny eyes? A trespasser. An interloper! But ya won't take my prey from me!\",\"id\":\"s7_4489\",\"timestamp\":1773867868},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Muro'jin yells: Nekraxx! No!\",\"id\":\"s7_4490\",\"timestamp\":1773867992},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251176::::::::90:263::23:5:12785:13439:6652:13577:12699:1:28:3025:::::|h[Reanimator's Weight]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s7_4491\",\"timestamp\":1773867993},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 16 Gold, 98 Silver, 93 Copper (+33 Silver, 97 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s7_4492\",\"timestamp\":1773867994},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Kvotheen. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?\",\"id\":\"s7_4493\",\"timestamp\":1773867997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.\",\"id\":\"s7_4494\",\"timestamp\":1773868005},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Anglette-KhazModan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anglette-KhazModan|h[|cff3fc7ebAnglette-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61809:Player-3690-0AB333A6:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Adventurer of the Dawn]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s7_4495\",\"timestamp\":1773868013},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.\",\"id\":\"s7_4496\",\"timestamp\":1773868019},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!\",\"id\":\"s7_4497\",\"timestamp\":1773868020},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.\",\"id\":\"s7_4498\",\"timestamp\":1773868026},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Anglette-KhazModan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anglette-KhazModan|h[|cff3fc7ebAnglette-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61678:Player-3690-0AB333A6:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Superior]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s7_4499\",\"timestamp\":1773868064},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Makrophage-Mannoroth\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Makrophage-Mannoroth receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s7_4500\",\"timestamp\":1773868097},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: It be worse than we thought. How many of my people have died here?\",\"id\":\"s7_4501\",\"timestamp\":1773868136},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Cvre-Mannoroth\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Cvre-Mannoroth receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s7_4502\",\"timestamp\":1773868215},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Voltarynn-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Voltarynn-Dalaran receives loot: 