ILD:|h[|cff33937fVoltarynn|r]|h: 80\",\"timestamp\":1774049422,\"id\":\"s8_3438\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: What took you so long, eh? De loa will not fight me without you.\",\"timestamp\":1774049433,\"id\":\"s8_3439\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Hold. Before ya face de loa, ya must face an' kill... me.\",\"timestamp\":1774049437,\"id\":\"s8_3440\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Leadership requires sacrifice. Even of the things we cherish.\",\"timestamp\":1774049444,\"id\":\"s8_3441\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Vilidøns-Dalaran\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Vilidøns-Dalaran:206:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Vilidøns|r]|h: merci volta !\",\"timestamp\":1774049444,\"id\":\"s8_3442\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done, Amani cub. You have... passed de trial. Take de Burden of Nalorakk.\",\"timestamp\":1774049474,\"id\":\"s8_3443\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: She has died honorably. But the death of those loyal to me... that is my burden. It will be yours as hash'ey.\",\"timestamp\":1774049488,\"id\":\"s8_3444\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Well done. Your strength rivals mine. The dream... ends.\",\"timestamp\":1774049573,\"id\":\"s8_3445\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"name\":\"Herza-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Herza-Eitrigg|h[|cfff48cbaHerza-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61900:Player-1122-0B39B1DC:1:3:21:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Shadowguard Point Discoveries]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774049580,\"id\":\"s8_3446\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::90:263::1::1:28:3022:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1774049581,\"id\":\"s8_3447\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 25 Gold, 47 Silver, 11 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1774049582,\"id\":\"s8_3448\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Haïneko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",