16},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: One of Alleria's scouting maps is within. It seems to have called on the ghosts of vengeance past. We'll need that map from them.\",\"timestamp\":1774304186,\"id\":\"s9_2671\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1774304215,\"id\":\"s9_2672\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260687::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Decaying Leather]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1774304216,\"id\":\"s9_2673\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Kroluk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Commander Kroluk yells: Honorless... scum...\",\"timestamp\":1774304305,\"id\":\"s9_2674\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 13 Gold, 16 Silver, 30 Copper (+26 Silver, 32 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1774304307,\"id\":\"s9_2675\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"HighmountainTauren\",\"name\":\"Bastett-ConfrérieduThorium\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Bastett-ConfrérieduThorium receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251092::::::::90:263::23:5:12785:13439:6652:13577:12699:1:28:3025:::::|h[Fallen Grunt's Mantle]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1774304308,\"id\":\"s9_2676\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: We've done it! One last task remains.\",\"timestamp\":1774304310,\"id\":\"s9_2677\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: I'll use these relics to return peace to the spire. Perhaps then my sisters will return to me.\",\"timestamp\":1774304322,\"id\":\"s9_2678\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: There! The restless heart that haunts us! Please, lay it to rest.\",\"timestamp\":1774304329,\"id\":\"s9_2679\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Heart\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Restless Heart yells: At... last...\",\"timestamp\":1774304400,\"id\":\"s9_2680\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3059|h[Loot]|h: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256683::::::::90:263::23:::::::|h[Silvermoon Training Dummy]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1774304401,\"id\":\"s9_2681\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\