You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:250116::::::::90:263::11::1:28:4240:::::|h[Cache of Quel'Thalas Treasures]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1774434147,\"id\":\"s10_2591\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249919::::::::90:263::3:4:6652:13668:13333:12787:1:28:4240:::::|h[Sin'dorei Band of Hope]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1774434150,\"id\":\"s10_2592\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3260:0|h[Artisan Herbalist's Moxie]|h|rx15\",\"timestamp\":1774434174,\"id\":\"s10_2593\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3154:0|h[Midnight Herbalism Knowledge]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1774434174,\"id\":\"s10_2594\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Cousin Slowhands\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Cousin Slowhands says: Ten years. I have faithfully brushed yak for ten years.\",\"timestamp\":1774434286,\"id\":\"s10_2595\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are deep in enemy territory. Time to strike!\",\"timestamp\":1774434354,\"id\":\"s10_2596\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Oh, Alleria. If I had known you would all simply kill each other, I wouldn't have gone through all this effort.\",\"timestamp\":1774434379,\"id\":\"s10_2597\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kybel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kybel says: Let's all buff up.\",\"timestamp\":1774434382,\"id\":\"s10_2598\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Anyone peckish? Mage table ready.\",\"timestamp\":1774434385,\"id\":\"s10_2599\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: But perhaps I shouldn't be surprised. Not after Turalyon cut open your own son.\",\"timestamp\":1774434388,\"id\":\"s10_2600\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner yells: Enough! I'll rip out your tongue, Xal'atath!\",\"timestamp\":1774434396,\"id\":\"s10_2601\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Mother, wait!\",\"timestamp\":1774434400,\"id\":\"s10_2602\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: We can't let her face Xal'atath alone! Umbric, bring everyone up there!\",\"timestamp\":1774434401,\"id\":\"s10_2603\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: This may feel a little uncomfortable.\",\"timestamp\":1774434451,\"id\":\"s10_2604\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: We must make haste. Xal'atath is using Alleria's rage and pain to erode her mastery over the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1774434460,\"id\":\"s10_2605\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.\",\"timestamp\":1774434470,\"id\":\"s10_2606\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Mother!\",\"timestamp\":1774434484,\"id\":\"s10_2607\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: Alleria!\",\"timestamp\":1774434486,\"id\":\"s10_2608\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: How touching. Your family has come to say goodbye.\",\"timestamp\":1774434488,\"id\":\"s10_2609\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.\",\"timestamp\":1774434494,\"id\":\"s10_2610\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.\",\"timestamp\":1774434503,\"id\":\"s10_2611\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!\",\"timestamp\":1774434504,\"id\":\"s10_2612\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Keeping my promise, of course. Taking everything she loves. Leaving her with nothing but the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1774434505,\"id\":\"s10_2613\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: No!\",\"timestamp\":1774434513,\"id\":\"s10_2614\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: I... can't move!\",\"timestamp\":1774434519,\"id\":\"s10_2615\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61366:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Voidspire]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774434536,\"id\":\"s10_2616\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61637:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Voidspire: Crown of the Cosmos]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774434536,\"id\":\"s10_2617\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Marchegland-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Marchegland-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61805:Player-1302-0C0AF890:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 9 (Season 1)]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774434710,\"id\":\"s10_2618\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Marchegland-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Marchegland-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61729:Player-1302-0C0AF890:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Atal'Aman Stories]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774434710,\"id\":\"s10_2619\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner yells: She... must be... stopped.\",\"timestamp\":1774434816,\"id\":\"s10_2620\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61366:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Voidspire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774434816,\"id\":\"s10_2621\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61637:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Voidspire: Crown of the Cosmos]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774434816,\"id\":\"s10_2622\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61366:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Voidspire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774434816,\"id\":\"s10_2623\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61637:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Voidspire: Crown of the Cosmos]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774434816,\"id\":\"s10_2624\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:257175::::::::90:263::42:3:12785:6652:13577:1:28:3320:::::|h[Voidbreaker's Wrap]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1774434969,\"id\":\"s10_2625\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3344:0|h[Champion Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1774434970,\"id\":\"s10_2626\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: We... we need to let Lor'themar know what's happened. You go ahead of us, Kvotheen.\",\"timestamp\":1774435025,\"id\":\"s10_2627\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The dark power pouring out of the Sunwell... I can feel it even from here.\",\"timestamp\":1774435068,\"id\":\"s10_2628\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1774435092,\"id\":\"s10_2629\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Champion, place these tokens on any survivors you find. They will allow my Magisters to teleport them to safety.\",\"timestamp\":1774435098,\"id\":\"s10_2630\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The survivors suffer under a stain of Void corruption. I do not believe we can count on their aid for some time.\",\"timestamp\":1774435155,\"id\":\"s10_2631\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 5 Gold, 58 Silver, 66 Copper (+11 Silver, 16 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1774435199,\"id\":\"s10_2632\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 17 Silver, 1 Copper (+4 Silver, 34 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1774435235,\"id\":\"s10_2633\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: The Sunwell corrupted! The Vanguard swept away as if they were nothing! How will we survive this?\",\"timestamp\":1774435242,\"id\":\"s10_2634\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62181:Player-1390-0C65DBA2:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Chasing Death (Nightmare)]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774435264,\"id\":\"s10_2635\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Is the Darkwell a foothold for Xal'atath? Will her Devouring Host spill out to corrupt all of Azeroth?\",\"timestamp\":1774435336,\"id\":\"s10_2636\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: We need to assault the Darkwell and take it back from Xal'atath.\",\"timestamp\":1774435391,\"id\":\"s10_2637\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1774435392,\"id\":\"s10_2638\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: With what army, Arator? The Vanguard is gone.\",\"timestamp\":1774435396,\"id\":\"s10_2639\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Then we will find an army! Xal'atath's Devouring Host will not stay in Quel'Danas forever. All of Azeroth is in danger.\",\"timestamp\":1774435401,\"id\":\"s10_2640\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Xal'atath won the battle of the Voidspire, but all is not lost. We can still fight!\",\"timestamp\":1774435431,\"id\":\"s10_2641\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The problem isn't just retaking the Isle of Quel'Danas. We have to cleanse the corrupted Darkwell. We need military might and magical expertise.\",\"timestamp\":1774435438,\"id\":\"s10_2642\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I propose we call upon the other elven people for aid. And not just those from Quel'Thalas.\",\"timestamp\":1774435448,\"id\":\"s10_2643\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: We should send a diplomatic mission to Bel'ameth and entreat the night elves for their aid.\",\"timestamp\":1774435455,\"id\":\"s10_2644\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: They will extract a price.\",\"timestamp\":1774435461,\"id\":\"s10_2645\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: And we invite the high elves and the Silver Covenant to join our efforts.\",\"timestamp\":1774435464,\"id\":\"s10_2646\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: Those butchers will not set foot inside our city!\",\"timestamp\":1774435470,\"id\":\"s10_2647\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: You are wrong about them! Of all the peoples of Azeroth, the elves understand the threat of the Darkwell.\",\"timestamp\":1774435475,\"id\":\"s10_2648\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: If we are to survive, we must put aside past battles. We must contact the other elven people.\",\"timestamp\":1774435482,\"id\":\"s10_2649\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: To Bel'ameth then. Arator, seek out your aunt. We will accept aid from anyone that would fight against Xal'atath and her Devouring Host.\",\"timestamp\":1774435498,\"id\":\"s10_2650\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Marchegland-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Marchegland-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62164:Player-1302-0C0AF890:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: No Rest for the Wretched (Hard)]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774435532,\"id\":\"s10_2651\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62120:Player-1390-0C65DBA2:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: The Penitent Troll]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774435662,\"id\":\"s10_2652\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Marchegland-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Marchegland-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61806:Player-1302-0C0AF890:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 10 (Season 1)]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774436524,\"id\":\"s10_2653\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maiev Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Maiev Shadowsong says: Once again, that accursed Sunwell has been corrupted by vile magic. Predictable.\",\"timestamp\":1774436811,\"id\":\"s10_2654\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Dordok-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dordok-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Dordok-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42767:Player-1335-06882EAF:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Veteran of the Dawn]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1774436979,\"id\":\"s10_2655\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: What has befallen the people in Silvermoon? Tell me of the doom that threatens you.\",\"id\":\"s10_2656\",\"timestamp\":1774439149},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Kractys\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kractys:24:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff8788eeKractys|r|h thinks Ladovorer-Dalaran is the son of a motherless ogre.\",\"id\":\"s10_2657\",\"timestamp\":1774439198},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Justhunt-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Justhunt-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Justhunt-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42767:Player-1335-06F2340A:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Veteran of the Dawn]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2658\",\"timestamp\":1774439271},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell has fallen. Xal'atath has twisted its power to the Void, creating the Darkwell.\",\"id\":\"s10_2659\",\"timestamp\":1774439285},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: This much Void energy will soon spill from the Sunwell, corrupting all of Azeroth. It must be stopped.\",\"id\":\"s10_2660\",\"timestamp\":1774439359},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Even now, my people gather their own army to lend to the sin'dorei. We remember those who aided us in the past.\",\"id\":\"s10_2661\",\"timestamp\":1774439384},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: I have heard enough. The Void is a threat to all of Azeroth. You will have our armies.\",\"id\":\"s10_2662\",\"timestamp\":1774439393},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s10_2663\",\"timestamp\":1774439407},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: Kvotheen, please aid Maiev with awakening the ancients and preparing them for war.\",\"id\":\"s10_2664\",\"timestamp\":1774439492},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maiev Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maiev Shadowsong says: The sin'dorei continue the ancient elven tradition of not learning from their disastrous mistakes.\",\"id\":\"s10_2665\",\"timestamp\":1774439506},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maiev Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maiev Shadowsong says: It was the incessant need for a fount of power that destroyed our civilization and brought our home to ruin.\",\"id\":\"s10_2666\",\"timestamp\":1774439582},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Naramis-ConfrérieduThorium\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Naramis-ConfrérieduThorium|h[|cfff48cbaNaramis-ConfrérieduThorium|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:10750:Player-1127-0B360686:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Fighting with Style: Hidden]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2667\",\"timestamp\":1774439612},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Marchegland-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Marchegland-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Marchegland-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62156:Player-1302-0C0AF890:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Anger Management (Hard)]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2668\",\"timestamp\":1774439632},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maiev Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maiev Shadowsong says: Each time the Sunwell comes under attack, the blood elves suffer in the aftermath. And yet they cling to it.\",\"id\":\"s10_2669\",\"timestamp\":1774439659},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maiev Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maiev Shadowsong says: Once again, the Sunwell invites corruption and calamity. How many times must its mere existence imperil our world?\",\"id\":\"s10_2670\",\"timestamp\":1774439750},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The kaldorei forces make this fight possible, but we will need more allies to be assured of victory.\",\"id\":\"s10_2671\",\"timestamp\":1774439777},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251782::::::::90:263::25:2:6652:12769:1:28:3320:::::|h[Withered Saptor's Paw]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_2672\",\"timestamp\":1774439783},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s10_2673\",\"timestamp\":1774439784},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:257234::::::::90:263::25:2:12769:6652:1:28:3320:::::|h[Voidbreaker's Waraxe]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_2674\",\"timestamp\":1774439785},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s10_2675\",\"timestamp\":1774439786},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:257248::::::::90:263::25:2:12769:6652:1:28:3320:::::|h[Voidbreaker's Hammer]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_2676\",\"timestamp\":1774439786},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s10_2677\",\"timestamp\":1774439787},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42786:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Leatherworking at Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2678\",\"timestamp\":1774439791},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61314:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Furniture Historian]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2679\",\"timestamp\":1774439791},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Cïarrah-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cïarrah-KhazModan|h[|cfff48cbaCïarrah-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61637:Player-3690-08F60A13:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Voidspire: Crown of the Cosmos]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2680\",\"timestamp\":1774439793},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Herza-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Herza-Eitrigg|h[|cfff48cbaHerza-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:11183:Player-1122-0B39B1DC:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Keystone Initiate]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2681\",\"timestamp\":1774439816},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Herza-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Herza-Eitrigg|h[|cfff48cbaHerza-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61254:Player-1122-0B39B1DC:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Keystone Explorer: Season One]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_2682\",\"timestamp\":1774439816},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The conflict between the blood elves and the high elves of the Silver Covenant is still fresh. I foresee problems on both sides.\",\"id\":\"s10_2683\",\"timestamp\":1774439842},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: Lor'themar, I've attached no conditions to my aid. A corrupted Sunwell is an existential threat that cannot be ignored.\",\"id\":\"s10_2684\",\"timestamp\":1774439855},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Both our peoples have moved beyond the conflicts of the past. A hopeful sign for the future.\",\"id\":\"s10_2685\",\"timestamp\":1774439866},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: However, this marks the third time that evil has descended upon Quel'Danas and placed our world in peril.\",\"id\":\"s10_2686\",\"timestamp\":1774439872},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zaeya-KirinTor\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Zaeya-KirinTor:308:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aZaeya|r]|h: u_u m'a fillé un collier pour SP u_u\",\"id\":\"s10_2687\",\"timestamp\":1774439872},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zaeya-KirinTor\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Zaeya-KirinTor:309:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aZaeya|r]|h: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249368::::::::90:105::3:4:6652:13668:13333:12790:1:28:4240:::::|h[Chaîne éternelle de Chantevide]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_2688\",\"timestamp\":1774439875},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: Should we survive this crisis, I ask that you do not attempt to reignite the Sunwell. It is time to find a different path.\",\"id\":\"s10_2689\",\"timestamp\":1774439882},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: You said there were no conditions.\",\"id\":\"s10_2690\",\"timestamp\":1774439891},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: None for our army to join the battle. But the Sunwell invites catastrophe and conflict. For the sake of your people, you must let it go.\",\"id\":\"s10_2691\",\"timestamp\":1774439895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:319:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: y'a une arme de delve qui fait des dégats d'ombre x3\",\"id\":\"s10_2692\",\"timestamp\":1774439900},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: You can't ask that of me. The Sunwell defines us. Without it, we were nothing--weak and powerless.\",\"id\":\"s10_2693\",\"timestamp\":1774439906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: We kaldorei once faced a similar fear. Losing our immortality was a cruel fate, and those who sought to regain it committed terrible crimes.\",\"id\":\"s10_2694\",\"timestamp\":1774439914},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: So believe me when I say that I know how you feel. But I also know that your people's resilience far eclipses their reliance on the Sunwell.\",\"id\":\"s10_2695\",\"timestamp\":1774439927},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zaeya-KirinTor\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Zaeya-KirinTor:331:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aZaeya|r]|h: mais j'ai pas l'arme de delve donc me sert à rien\",\"id\":\"s10_2696\",\"timestamp\":1774439935},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I will... consider it.\",\"id\":\"s10_2697\",\"timestamp\":1774439939},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Khennaï-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Khennaï-Hyjal:356:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKhennaï|r]|h: kakoo kakoo\",\"id\":\"s10_2698\",\"timestamp\":1774439985},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zaeya-KirinTor\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.