 Arcanist Thalyssra says: Well done. The Twilight's Blade will not best the shal'dorei this day. Now to bring Ulen's killer to justice.\",\"timestamp\":1774462568,\"id\":\"s10_3223\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Dordok-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Dordok-Ysondre:207:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Dordok|r]|h: 2v2 ou 3v3\",\"timestamp\":1774462573,\"id\":\"s10_3224\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::90:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1774462575,\"id\":\"s10_3225\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Valeera Sanguinar:233:TEXT_EMOTE:|hValeera Sanguinar|h cheers at you.\",\"timestamp\":1774462649,\"id\":\"s10_3226\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Illusion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Twilight Illusion yells: Come closer...\",\"timestamp\":1774462649,\"id\":\"s10_3227\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Let this be a