\"id\":\"s10_3842\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1006:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: Machine à grouper activée!! Envoyez-moi +1 en MP pour être aspirés dans le raid !\",\"timestamp\":1774554481,\"id\":\"s10_3843\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: There are those who would look down upon us, champion--who would turn their noses at the blood we have spilled.\",\"timestamp\":1774554512,\"id\":\"s10_3844\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1033:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: Machine à grouper activée!! Envoyez-moi +1 en MP pour être aspirés dans le raid !\",\"timestamp\":1774554589,\"id\":\"s10_3845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: But from that blood we have drawn power. The power to defend our city. The power to annihilate our foes.\",\"timestamp\":1774554595,\"id\":\"s10_3846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: Just as Silvermoon was not rebuilt in a day, so too will the consequences of our work here unfold over the years to come. They might not be fully felt today, or tomorrow...\",\"timestamp\":1774554604,\"id\":\"s10_3847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: ...but when they are, all of Azeroth will come to fear the might and determination of the blood elves.\",\"timestamp\":1774554618,\"id\":\"s10_3848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: You are the teeth of my predation--a hero of the people!\",\"timestamp\":1774554647,\"id\":\"s10_3849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"To |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1054:WHISPER:ØSKYTANKUL-ARCHIMONDE|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: +1\",\"timestamp\":1774554656,\"id\":\"s10_3850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are deep in enemy territory. Time to strike!\",\"id\":\"s10_3851\",\"timestamp\":1774554724},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"H