HAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:263467::::::::90:263::11::2:9:90:28:3321:::::|h[Avid Learner's Supply Pack]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s16_3716\",\"timestamp\":1776889997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61574:Player-1390-09230B89:1:4:22:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Legends Never Die]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s16_3717\",\"timestamp\":1776889997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61574:Player-1390-09230B89:1:4:22:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Legends Never Die]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s16_3718\",\"timestamp\":1776889997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: I think now more than ever, we can use some of Awe'ohna's hope.\",\"id\":\"s16_3719\",\"timestamp\":1776889997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aksem\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aksem says: Now is the time. You have proven your dedication to our history, and your strength in combat. You are ready to learn the deepest truth of the Cradle.\",\"id\":\"s16_3720\",\"timestamp\":1776890019},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: What must we do to prepare our minds?\",\"id\":\"s16_3721\",\"timestamp\":1776890034},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aksem\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aksem says: You must be ready to change your very understanding of the goddess. Once you know the truth, you can't un-know it. There is no going back from here.\",\"id\":\"s16_3722\",\"timestamp\":1776890037},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"On'hiea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"On'hiea says: YOU! You took her. Stole her away! I'll kill you all!!\",\"id\":\"s16_3723\",\"timestamp\":1776890090},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236778::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Mana Lily |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s16_3724\",\"timestamp\":1776890096},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236778::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Mana Lily |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s16_372